{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13431","headline":"代员将军罢战後归故里 · 常衮","name":"代员将军罢战後归故里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结发事疆场，全生到海乡。\n连云防铁岭，同日破渔阳。\n牧马胡天晚，移军碛路长。\n枕戈眠古戍，吹角立繁霜。\n归老勳仍在，酬恩虏未忘。\n独行过邑里，多病对农桑。\n雄劒依尘橐，兵符寄药囊。\n空余麾下将，犹逐羽林郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13431.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13431","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}